          },
          "docs": "You can post custom object definitions with the request body schema described below. \n\nThis operation also allows you to use the [List custom object definitions](/api-references/api/operation/GET_AllCustomObjectDefinitionsInNamespace) response schema as its request schema. If you want to copy all the existing custom objects from an old tenant to a new tenant, you can make a [List custom object definitions](/api-references/api/operation/GET_AllCustomObjectDefinitionsInNamespace) call in your old "
        },
